Copyright: See inst/COPYRIGHTS for the bundled CivetWeb and Mbed TLS.
SystemRequirements: GNU make
Description: An embedded HTTP and WebSocket server. The bundled 'CivetWeb'
    <https://github.com/civetweb/civetweb> C library does the socket work
    on its own threads, and R handles one request or WebSocket event at a
    time on its main thread, so handlers need no locking. Static files are
    served from disk, TLS (Transport Layer Security) is terminated by the
    bundled 'Mbed TLS' <https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls>, and the
    event loop is exposed so an application can drive it from its own.
